'''Towns''' are areas inhabited by [[NPC]]s, which serve as hubs for different areas of the storyline. Every act has one town.

Upon entering a town, a player's [[flask]]s, [[life]], [[mana]], and [[energy shield]] will be completely restored. Players cannot take damage or use any of their skills while in town.

==List of towns==
* [[Lioneye's Watch (Act 1)|Act 1 - Lioneye's Watch]]
* [[The Forest Encampment|Act 2 - The Forest Encampment]]
* [[The Sarn Encampment (Act 3)|Act 3 - The Sarn Encampment]]
* [[Highgate (Act 4)|Act 4 - Highgate]]
* [[Overseer's Tower|Act 5 - Overseer's Tower]]
* [[Lioneye's Watch (Act 6)|Act 6 - Lioneye's Watch]]
* [[The Bridge Encampment|Act 7 - The Bridge Encampment]]
* [[The Sarn Encampment (Act 8)|Act 8 - The Sarn Encampment]]
* [[Highgate (Act 9)|Act 9 - Highgate]]
* [[Oriath Docks|Act 10 - Oriath Docks]]
* [[Oriath (Epilogue)|Epilogue - Oriath]] (No longer accessible. Replaced by the Karui Shores.)
* [[Karui Shores|Epilogue - Karui Shores]]

